From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 22:04:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dzn: keep compiled pipeline states in a D3D12 pipeline
 library on disk

---
 src/microsoft/vulkan/dzn_device.c   |   1 +
 src/microsoft/vulkan/dzn_pipeline.c | 260 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/microsoft/vulkan/dzn_private.h  |   3 +
 3 files changed, 255 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

